<p>Lay a trap that explodes in a radius of 2, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">181, 213, 237, 257, 275</acronym> physical damage and blinding and dazing (50% chance of each) any creature caught inside for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">6, 6, 6, 7, 7</acronym> turns.</p><p>This trap can use a primed trigger and a high level lure can trigger it.</p>